{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_032emi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_032emi02_title", "source_sha256": "a1f594fd7ff3786687c92356151d41bc5d797bd2e3ae1308fb3f4c206b0c402c", "ja": "エミリーとおでかけ2", "zh": "和艾米莉外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_032emi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_032emi02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b43dc9b6b0b4a1da2bc93a43074b2ec3fec778771ebd9fe90844f318be21cf4b", "ja": "エミリーとおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "和艾米莉外出一趟时发生的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_032emi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_032emi02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b12ea263741afa898b80ba9f6593c089c630ad6f841354c84ad88b04db55ff93", "ja": "（エミリーの強い希望で、伊賀忍者の体験施設に\nやってきた！　迫力満点のショーだったな……！）", "zh": "（在艾米莉的强烈请求下，我们来到了伊贺忍者体验馆！真是一场气势十足的表演啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_032emi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_032emi02_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "55914d9e593036ed93d50f69cb91fbc1e46dc48a036064f940c6bb1797dc2ebf", "ja": "素晴らしいです……！　やはり日本には今も、\n本物の忍者がいるんですね！", "zh": "太棒了……！果然日本现在也还有真正的忍者呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_032emi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_032emi02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2faaeb194a2fa6f55a32286e9cad267f9a75e2a4009c181642e6a8991e103bae", "ja": "いや、あれは本物じゃ……ん？\nなんだか、賑やかだな。", "zh": "不，那个不是真的……嗯？\n总觉得，那边挺热闹的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_032emi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_032emi02_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "6abcdb2b1a449e1e74176c3d4bfd0b0cfe60df24502274d9f2f4305b996076c2", "ja": "見てください、仕掛け人さま！\nあちらに、忍者がたくさんいますよ！", "zh": "请看，制作人先生！\n那边有好多忍者呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_032emi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_032emi02_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "5f775313a17a7bbd6357e74ffb4b45bdebdf73783abd14f00daec31cb6ca2c13", "ja": "小さい方まで……もしや、修行中でしょうか？", "zh": "连年纪小的人也在……莫非，是在修行中吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_032emi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_032emi02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "cbcc1cbdbd9d6b1c74cb37112c32583bc8a40de050d6f89eba537f600cba973c", "ja": "そうか、忍者体験で、衣装を着せてもらえるのか。\nエミリーもやってみるか？", "zh": "原来如此，在忍者体验活动中还能让人换上服装啊。\n艾米莉也要试试吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_032emi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_032emi02_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "62efa8b141c21f0df338016a284f7bc290b45f3b0500dda23430237c6e5ddef8", "ja": "えっ……！　は、はいっ、もちろんですっ！\nにんにん！　……よし、気合いも入りました！", "zh": "咦……！好、好的，当然愿意！  \n忍忍！……好，干劲也上来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_032emi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_032emi02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e75e5f525815b3e3899984797e12a1c533051d4d2f27921cfd6217e5c80f5a24", "ja": "はは、そうか。それじゃあ行こうか！", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。那我们走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_032emi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_032emi02_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "d3814f49cfac01c5ed8259ad3667c18f0da4c39e643070f9e02525bb2801a78f", "ja": "はい！　私、大和撫子の道を志していますが、\n今日だけは……立派なくのいちに、なってみせます！", "zh": "是！虽然我立志要走大和抚子的道路，但今天……我一定要成为一名出色的女忍者！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_032emi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_032emi02_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "ceeb39e575e5acc8a59929e6b98ba04bacc310217355153458ab1d7354a0e58b", "ja": "精神統一……！　手裏剣、まきびし、クナイ、\nしゅばばばばばっ！", "zh": "凝神静气……！手里剑、撒菱、苦无，嗖嗖嗖嗖嗖！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_032emi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_032emi02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d1d9537e598fa43d24f20ec6d910736171c462119c6c24e823fe2aebc1ff5014", "ja": "（その後の忍者体験で、エミリーはなかなかの\n活躍を見せていた。流石、経験者は違うな！）", "zh": "（之后的忍者体验中，艾米莉展现了相当出色的表现。不愧是有经验的人，果然不一样啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
